# Daydream: "Exile target creature you control, then return that card to the battlefield under its owner's control".
# Bot2's Dack Fayden takes Bot1's Ornithopter (an artifact creature), and Bot2 Daydreams the stolen creature: it
# is a creature Bot2 controls, so it is legal, and it returns under its owner Bot1's control (CR 400.7), with its
# +1/+1 counter (CR 122.6) - not under Bot2's.

